CopilotCliPageCaption=VEGA IDE CLI
CopilotCliPageDescription=Use VEGA IDE from any terminal with the copilot command.
CopilotCliPrompt=VEGA IDE CLI isn't installed on this computer. How would you like to set up the copilot command?
CopilotCliPromptBasic=How would you like to set up the copilot command?
CopilotCliPromptAllUsers=How would you like to set up the copilot command for users of this computer?
CopilotCliInstallNow=&Install VEGA IDE CLI now
CopilotCliInstallNowDescription=Adds copilot to PATH and downloads about %1 MB from GitHub after %2 is installed.
CopilotCliInstallNowDescriptionNoSize=Adds copilot to PATH and downloads VEGA IDE CLI from GitHub after %1 is installed.
CopilotCliFirstUse=Install VEGA IDE CLI when I &first run copilot
CopilotCliFirstUseDescription=Adds copilot to PATH. Nothing is downloaded until you run it and confirm.
CopilotCliAdd=&Add the copilot command
CopilotCliAddDescription=Adds copilot to PATH. VEGA IDE CLI is installed the first time you run copilot. This requires an internet connection.
CopilotCliAddAllUsers=&Add the copilot command for all users
CopilotCliAddAllUsersDescription=Adds copilot to PATH for all users. Each user is asked before VEGA IDE CLI is downloaded the first time they run copilot.
CopilotCliDontAdd=&Don't add the copilot command
CopilotCliDontAddDescription=copilot isn't added to PATH. You can still run it in the %1 terminal.
CopilotCliDontAddAllUsersDescription=copilot isn't added to PATH. Users can still run it in the %1 terminal.
CopilotCliLicenseNote=VEGA IDE CLI is a separate GitHub product with its own license terms, and it requires a VEGA IDE subscription.
CopilotCliPwshRecommended=It works with Windows PowerShell, and PowerShell 7 or later is recommended.
CopilotCliLearnMore=Learn more
CopilotCliChecking=Checking for VEGA IDE CLI...
CopilotCliMemoHeading=VEGA IDE CLI:
CopilotCliMemoInstallNow=Add copilot to PATH and install now (about %1 MB download)
CopilotCliMemoInstallNowNoSize=Add copilot to PATH and install now
CopilotCliMemoAdd=Add copilot to PATH
CopilotCliMemoDontAdd=Don't add copilot to PATH
CopilotCliMemoFound=Already installed at %1
CopilotCliInstallingCaption=Installing VEGA IDE CLI
CopilotCliInstallingDescription=Setup is downloading and installing VEGA IDE CLI.
CopilotCliDownloadingPhase=Downloading...
CopilotCliDownloadingProgress=Downloading... %1 MB of %2 MB
CopilotCliVerifyingPhase=Verifying...
CopilotCliInstallingPhase=Installing...
CopilotCliInstallFailed=%1 was installed, but VEGA IDE CLI couldn't be installed. The copilot command will offer to install it the first time you run it.
CopilotCliFinishedHint=Open a new terminal to use the copilot command.
